{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753840/extras/5111a9e043147d1a850ecb78b281a9df.avif?t=1772837062\" width=800 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thought about it: What if... you have to survive 40 days in a cabin in freezing temperatures but the house and the place itself really wants you dead. The game is a little bit inspired by the wicker devil by <i>shawcat.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my second game I made but the first one I published on Steam :D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753840/extras/eaa6e72c28626793423c7ec1c27d9722.avif?t=1772837062\" width=800 height=197 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You buy your grandfathers house again after he died, well not really because you lost a bet and then a woodchopper got it. He also eventually died so you decide to buy it again, but that was the biggest mistake you ever made. You listen to the tape the previous owner left behind and find the secrets of this old looking Cabin.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753840/extras/1c44deeecf5786f145422779035ee627.avif?t=1772837062\" width=1459 height=206 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-Paced action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VR</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scary horror stuffs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complicated Lore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploding deers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High quality sounds and music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frost Survival</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3753840?t=1772837062","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3753840?t=1772837062","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753840/9092d91a0d15bf9f459253f8e0c6bdfebbf1ab6c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772837062","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753840/9092d91a0d15bf9f459253f8e0c6bdfebbf1ab6c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772837062","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"In some in-game days you'd have to kill some animals for food."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753840/extras/5111a9e043147d1a850ecb78b281a9df.avif?t=1772837062\" width=800 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thought about it: What if... you have to survive 40 days in a cabin in freezing temperatures but the house and the place itself really wants you dead. The game is a little bit inspired by the wicker devil by <i>shawcat.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is my second game I made but the first one I published on Steam :D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753840/extras/eaa6e72c28626793423c7ec1c27d9722.avif?t=1772837062\" width=800 height=197 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You buy your grandfathers house again after he died, well not really because you lost a bet and then a woodchopper got it. He also eventually died so you decide to buy it again, but that was the biggest mistake you ever made. You listen to the tape the previous owner left behind and find the secrets of this old looking Cabin.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753840/extras/1c44deeecf5786f145422779035ee627.avif?t=1772837062\" width=1459 height=206 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-Paced action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VR</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scary horror stuffs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complicated Lore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploding deers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High quality sounds and music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frost Survival</p></li></ul>","developers":["MonkeLaysAnEgg"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753840/65766a309470905be145ce3160ba5c50068431f9/header.jpg?t=1772837062","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"FrostBite","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-13700F<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 28 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> OpenXR and SteamVr</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommen